UnitCanonGuardFactory::constructor
└── when called
    └── it should store the multi send call only address

UnitCanonGuardFactory::createCanonGuard
├── when called with valid parameters
│   ├── it should deploy a new CanonGuard
│   ├── it should match the parameters sent to the constructor
│   ├── it should set the parent address in the child contract
│   ├── it should store the contract as a factory children
│   └── it should emit CanonGuardCreated event with correct parameters
├── when the transaction expiry delay is less than the minimum expiry time
│   └── it reverts
└── when the maximum approval duration is less than the minimum expiry time
    └── it reverts
